  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttonText:
    fi: "\n\nLukemalla vihkoa\r\npystyt selvi\xE4m\xE4\xE4n paremmin\r\nkosteikon
      tapahtumista, olivat ne\r\nsitten negatiivisia tai positiivisia ja\r\nsaat
      yleisesti t\xE4rke\xE4\xE4 tietoa\r\nkosteikoista.\u200B\n"
    sw: "\n\nGenom att l\xE4sa handboken\nkan du b\xE4ttre hantera\nh\xE4ndelser
      i v\xE5tmarken, oavsett om de \xE4r\nnegativa eller positiva och\ndu f\xE5r
      allm\xE4nt viktig information\nom v\xE5tmarker."
    en: '


      By reading the handbook

      you can better navigate

      wetland
      events, whether they are

      negative or positive and

      you''ll generally
      get important information

      about wetlands.'
