--- !u!114 &6165847393784725645
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4917871336892547567}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 36422ed2236b4ef4d88887b861d3bdcc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttonText:
    fi: "Hei! \n\nT\xE4ss\xE4 on kosteikkovihkosi, jonka\r\nannan sinulle nyt kun
      siirryt\r\nhoitamaan kosteikkoa. \n\nVihkosta l\xF6yd\xE4t tietoa kosteikoista
      ja siihen\r\nvaikuttavista asioista. \n\nTietoa l\xF6ytyy\r\nesimerkiksi kosteikon
      eri el\xE4imist\xE4 ja\r\nveden laadusta. \n"
    sw: "Hej!\nH\xE4r \xE4r din v\xE5tmarkshandbok, som\njag ger dig nu n\xE4r du
      g\xE5r vidare\ntill att f\xF6rvalta v\xE5tmarken.\nI handboken hittar du information
      om v\xE5tmarker och\nfaktorer som p\xE5verkar dem.\nDu hittar information\ntill
      exempel om olika djur i v\xE5tmarken och\nvattenkvalitet."
    en: 'Hi!

      Here is your wetland handbook, which

      I''m giving to you
      now as you move on

      to manage the wetland.

      In the handbook, you''ll
      find information about wetlands and the

      factors affecting them.

      There
      is information

      for example about different animals in the wetland and

      water
      quality.'
